§ `Tests — column B, the hours (trap T6)`

-- FS5.  "Training of up to N hours" is a ceiling on the course: the hours the applicant must complete are not stated.
#ASSERT `Second Schedule — the ceiling on the hours of` (`training of up to` 350 `a Training Division certificate of grade 1`) EQUALS 350
#ASSERT REFUSED `Second Schedule — the hours the applicant must complete under` (`training of up to` 350 `a Training Division certificate of grade 1`)
