#ASSERT `the item numbers under` (`the reading with a year of cumulative experience counted in days (FS7a)` 366) `for a` `grade 1 licence` `by` (`an applicant with only the periods of work` `365 days of work to 31.8.2026`) `made on` `the usual application day` EQUALS LIST 1
